See licenses/ODbL-1.0-SIMBAD.txt and tools/assets/data/skies.json for the source
extract; firmware/main/tess_sky_catalog.h is its generated projection.
Database: https://simbad.cds.unistra.fr/simbad/
Reference: Wenger et al. (2000), A&AS 143, 9, doi:10.1051/aas:2000332.
Original catalog and projection source: https://github.com/pfrankov/kubik
Constellation names and chart cross-check: IAU / Sky & Telescope, Roger Sinnott
and Rick Fienberg, https://iauarchive.eso.org/public/themes/constellations/.
No chart artwork is included; the simplified bright-star links are teaching figures,
not official IAU boundaries or a standardized IAU stick figure.
